/F1 9 Tf
11.3 TL
34 802.0 Td
() Tj T*
(================================================================================) Tj T*
(  SONDA ESP32 + Raspberry Pi Zero W  --  GUIA DE SOLDAGEM \(5 fios\)) Tj T*
(  firmware: sonda_i2c  |  2026-08-01  |  niveis 3,3V dos 2 lados \(sem shifter\)) Tj T*
(================================================================================) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  OS 5 FIOS  \(I2C = telemetria ; UART = terminal\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(     ESP32                                   Raspberry Pi Zero W) Tj T*
(   +----------+                            +----------------------+) Tj T*
(   |  GPIO21  |---- SDA  \(NAO cruza\) ------|  pino 3   \(SDA\)      |) Tj T*
(   |  GPIO22  |---- SCL  \(NAO cruza\) ------|  pino 5   \(SCL\)      |) Tj T*
(   |  GPIO17  |==== TX  >>> CRUZA >>> =====|  pino 10  \(RXD\)     |) Tj T*
(   |  GPIO16  |==== RX  <<< CRUZA <<< =====|  pino 8   \(TXD\)     |) Tj T*
(   |   GND    |---- GND ------------------ |  pino 6   \(GND\)     |) Tj T*
(   +----------+                            +----------------------+) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(   REGRA:  I2C nao cruza \(SDA<->SDA, SCL<->SCL\)) Tj T*
(           UART cruza    \(TX->RX dos dois lados\)) Tj T*
(           GND comum e OBRIGATORIO \(referencia dos 2 barramentos\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  --------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj T*
(  TABELA RESUMO) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(    #  | funcao        | ESP32        | Pi \(pino fisico\)   | cruza?) Tj T*
(   ----+---------------+--------------+--------------------+-------) Tj T*
(    1  | I2C dados SDA | GPIO21       | 3                  | nao) Tj T*
(    2  | I2C clock SCL | GPIO22       | 5                  | nao) Tj T*
(    3  | UART ESP->Pi  | GPIO17 \(TX2\) | 10 \(RXD\)           | SIM) Tj T*
(    4  | UART Pi->ESP  | GPIO16 \(RX2\) | 8  \(TXD\)           | SIM) Tj T*
(    5  | terra comum   | GND          | 6                  | -) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
endstream
